# What the scripts write, and where: timing runs to ../results-legacy/ (meant to be committed); builds, venv, pip
# cache, animations (VTK files, frames, GIF) and job logs to the machine's work folder (experiments.MACHINES:
# ../build/legacy/ on the laptop, ignored by ../.gitignore); remote.py fetch copies the boards' logs and animations
# to ../00_private_data/ (ignored there too). Nothing is written into this folder except bytecode, which the
# scripts turn off and the root .gitignore ignores anyway:
__pycache__/
*.pyc
